# ============================================================================
# common/structural/receipt — FROZEN receipt contract (StageReceipt /
# VerificationReceipt, architecture §26 artifact group 7)
#
# Architecture §21 (execution framework), §21.3 (stage receipt), §21.4
# (fallback rules), §6.4 (MappingShardRef deferred to this group).
# Contract document:
# doc/05_design/platform/structural_compute/receipt_contract_v1.md
#
# `StageReceipt` itself is NOT re-exported from here: it belongs to
# structural/execution/contracts.spl and is already exported there. Exporting
# it twice is how two import paths for one type come to disagree. What this
# module adds is the frozen wire form and the selection-provenance rules.
#
# Explicit re-exports only — no `export use *`, which the linter flags for
# exposing unnecessary interface.
# ============================================================================

